the database.

00:14:30.561 --> 00:14:32.850
You have to set a database.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.300
This is the organism limit.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:40.270
That is the tax ID for humans.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:45.220
Exactly the same as doing this.

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:47.230
We can run that.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:48.610
Primer blast takes a moment to run.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:56.920
