00:29:09.840 --> 00:29:10.840
We did not get to all five examples.

00:29:10.840 --> 00:29:11.840
They are all spelled out for you in there.

00:29:11.840 --> 00:29:15.690
If you have any questions about this, you
can write to me about those examples.

